sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: The CSMS is able to request a new firmware update,<br>while there is already one ongoing on the Charging Station
    Note over CS,CSMS: Configuration State: N/a<br>Memory State: N/a<br>Reusable State(s): N/a

    CSMS->>CS: UpdateFirmwareRequest
    CS-->>CSMS: UpdateFirmwareResponse (status = Accepted)

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Downloading)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CSMS->>CS: UpdateFirmwareRequest
    CS-->>CSMS: UpdateFirmwareResponse (status = AcceptedCanceled)

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Downloading)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Downloaded)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = SignatureVerified)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Installing)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = InstallRebooting)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse

    CS->>CSMS: BootNotificationRequest (reason = FirmwareUpdate)
    CSMS-->>CS: BootNotificationResponse
    Note over CSMS: Validation: BootNotificationResponse<br>status must be Accepted

    Note over CS,CSMS: Step 19-20: The Test System notifies the CSMS about the current state of all connectors
    alt StatusNotification
        CS->>CSMS: StatusNotificationRequest (connectorStatus = Available)
        CSMS-->>CS: StatusNotificationResponse
    else NotifyEvent
        CS->>CSMS: NotifyEventRequest (trigger = Delta, actualValue = "Available",<br>component.name = "Connector", variable.name = "AvailabilityState")
        CSMS-->>CS: NotifyEventResponse
    end

    CS->>CSMS: FirmwareStatusNotificationRequest (status = Installed)
    CSMS-->>CS: FirmwareStatusNotificationResponse
